  itemDescription: "Use your <color=#FFF8A1>2 Spells</color> to knock Opponents out
    of the Arena.\n\n<color=#CB98ED>Pick Up</color> new Spells from the Ground, this
    will reset their <color=#CB98ED>Cooldown</color>.\n\nHit Players with Spells
    to build\nup <color=#FF3D5E>Damage</color>. The more\nDamage they have, the farther\nthey
    will be<color=#FF3D5E> knocked back</color>. \n\nTest out the Spells on the <color=#FFF8A1>
    Training Ground</color>."
